Package: rsahelpers
Title: Helpers for Response Surface Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Francisco", "Wilhelm", , "francisco.wilhelm@unibe.ch",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1717-7975"))
Description: Provides response surface analysis helpers, including one- and
    two-seam Edwards-Parry spline regression models for congruence research and
    extraction and plotting of polynomial response surfaces from Mplus output.
